Subject: [PATCH 19/41] =?UTF-8?q?ChopGimp:=20options=20bar=20=E2=80=94=20s?=
 =?UTF-8?q?eparate=20fill/stroke=20opacity=20and=20stroke=20style=20for=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?the=20path=20tool?=
